<main class="main">
  <div class="clip-path-layer">
    <section class="section">
      <div class="wrapper">
        <div class="grid--two-col">
          <div class="text-container">
            <h1>Contact Us!</h1>
            <p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet consectetur adipisicing elit. Vel ipsam provident neque consequatur sint modi impedit accusamus nulla, et enim doloribus cum ex amet atque aliquid. Quo nihil sapiente possimus?
            </p>
            <ul class="contact-methods">
              <li><i class="fa-solid fa-shield-cat"></i><a href="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1486530555807-11f29d0dff36?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&ixid=M3wxMjA3fDB8MHxwaG90by1wYWdlfHx8fGVufDB8fHx8fA%3D%3D&auto=format&fit=crop&w=2940&q=80">Via Messenger Cat (#1 contact method)</a></li>
              <li><i class="fa-brands fa-facebook-messenger"></i></i><a href="">Facebook Messenger</a></li>
              <li><i class="fa-brands fa-square-whatsapp"></i><a href="">WhatsApp</a></li>
              <li><i class="fa-solid fa-phone"></i><a href="">Phone</a></li>
              <li><i class="fa-solid fa-envelope"></i><a href="">Email</a></li>
            </ul>

          </div>
          <figure class="img-container img-msg-to-chrissy">
            <img src="/assets/img/content/contact-placeholder.jpg" alt="">
            <div class="overlay">
              <p>Brilliant idea: Ask Miikka to get a landscape picture of you working on your laptop and either Pepper or Snickers (or both) at your side!</p>
            </div>
          </figure>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</main>
